From: NWA50BE OpenWrt Project <noreply@invalid.example>
Subject: [PATCH] base-files: remove the downstream default root password
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

TIP's development image sets the public default password "openwifi". This
standalone image configures management only from the serial console, so retain
OpenWrt's empty initial root password until nwa50be-setup sets a unique one.

--- a/package/base-files/files/etc/shadow
+++ b/package/base-files/files/etc/shadow
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-root:$1$Ev771IIe$RHpqhCLW3U6c5tg9MrkQD/:18473:0:99999:7:::
+root::0:0:99999:7:::
 daemon:*:0:0:99999:7:::
 ftp:*:0:0:99999:7:::
 network:*:0:0:99999:7:::
